ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Needle-phobia that would preclude blood-letting\n-  Participants unwilling to consent\n-  Patients that have a conventional contraindication for cardiac magnetic resonance imaging (MRI).\n-  Patients that have had a blood transfusion within the last month and patients having haemodialysis will be excluded.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Needle-phobia that would preclude blood-letting",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "blood-letting"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "blood-letting"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "Needle-phobia"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Needle-phobia"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "would"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Participants unwilling to consent"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients that have a conventional contraindication for cardiac magnetic resonance imaging (MRI).",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "cardiac magnetic resonance imaging",\n            "MRI"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "cardiac magnetic resonance imaging",\n            "MRI"\n          ],\n          "Contraindication": [\n            "contraindication"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients that have had a blood transfusion within the last month",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "blood transfusion"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "blood transfusion"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "within"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "month"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "within the last month"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "last"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "and patients having haemodialysis will be excluded.",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "haemodialysis"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "haemodialysis"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "will be"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
