ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  known extensive intra-abdominal adhesions\n-  anaesthesiological contraindications to laparoscopy\n-  women with pacemaker or other implants where electrosurgery is to be avoided\n-  women with known defects of the hemostasis\n-  pregnancy\n-  other internal or anatomical criteria that preclude a minimal invasive approach\n-  inability to understand patient information\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- known extensive intra-abdominal adhesions",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "intra-abdominal adhesions"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "intra-abdominal adhesions"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "extensive"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "- anaesthesiological contraindications to laparoscopy",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "laparoscopy"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "laparoscopy"\n                              ],\n                              "Contraindication": [\n                                "contraindications"\n                              ],\n                              "Provider": [\n                                "anaesthesiological"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- women with pacemaker",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "pacemaker"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "pacemaker"\n                              ],\n                              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                                "women"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or other implants where electrosurgery is to be avoided",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "implants",\n                                "electrosurgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "implants",\n                                "electrosurgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Other": [\n                                "other"\n                              ],\n                              "Assertion": [\n                                "to be"\n                              ],\n                              "Contraindication": [\n                                "avoided"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- women with known defects of the hemostasis",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "defects of the hemostasis"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "defects of the hemostasis"\n                      ],\n                      "Life-Stage-AndGender": [\n                        "women"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- pregnancy",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "pregnancy"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "pregnancy"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- other internal",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "internal"\n                  ],\n                  "Other": [\n                    "other"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or anatomical criteria that preclude a minimal invasive approach",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "minimal invasive approach"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "minimal invasive approach"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "anatomical"\n                  ],\n                  "Contraindication": [\n                    "preclude"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- inability to understand patient information",\n          "Condition": [\n            "inability to understand"\n          ],\n    