ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Exclusion criteria included the following: a) patients with rheumatic diseases, cervical hernia, cervical whiplash syndrome, neck surgeries or history of arthrodesis, b) systemic diseases, c) vision, hearing or vestibular problems, d) Severe trauma or traffic accident which has had an impact on the cervical area.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Exclusion criteria included the following: a) patients with rheumatic diseases,      cervical hernia,      cervical whiplash syndrome,      neck surgeries",\n      "Condition": [\n        "rheumatic diseases",\n        "cervical hernia",\n        "cervical whiplash syndrome"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "rheumatic diseases",\n        "cervical hernia",\n        "cervical whiplash syndrome"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "neck surgeries"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "neck surgeries"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "or history of arthrodesis,          b) systemic diseases,          c) vision,          hearing",\n          "Condition": [\n            "arthrodesis",\n            "systemic diseases"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "arthrodesis",\n            "systemic diseases"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "vision",\n            "hearing"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or vestibular problems,          d) Severe trauma or traffic accident which has had an impact on the cervical area.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "vestibular problems"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "vestibular problems"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "trauma"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "trauma"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "cervical area"\n          ],\n          "Severity": [\n            "Severe"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "traffic accident"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "traffic accident"\n          ],\n          "Stability": [\n            "impact"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
