ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Volunteers that did not have Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction, that did not present medical and/or physiotherapeutic release for physical/sports activities, who have participated in strength training program for the plantar flexors in the last 6 months, patients with diabetic diseases, as well as those with difficulty for understanding and/or executing the test and training protocols in the isokinetic dynamometer will be excluded.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "raw_text": "- Volunteers that did not have Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction, that did not present medical and/or physiotherapeutic release for physical/sports activities, who have participated in strength training program for the plantar flexors in the last 6 months, patients with diabetic diseases, as well as those with difficulty for understanding and/or executing the test and training protocols in the isokinetic dynamometer will be excluded.",\n  "Procedure": [\n    "Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction",\n    "medical and/or physiotherapeutic release",\n    "strength training program",\n    "isokinetic dynamometer"\n  ],\n  "Procedure-Name": [\n    "Achilles tendon surgical reconstruction",\n    "medical and/or physiotherapeutic release",\n    "strength training program",\n    "isokinetic dynamometer"\n  ],\n  "Condition": [\n    "diabetic diseases"\n  ],\n  "Condition-Name": [\n    "diabetic diseases"\n  ],\n  "Modifier": [\n    "plantar flexors",\n    "physical",\n    "sports"\n  ],\n  "Eq-Comparison": [\n    "last 6 months"\n  ],\n  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n   