ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. The presence of uncontrolled systemic disease.\n2. Previous radiotherapy on head and neck region.\n3. Chemotherapy within the past 12-month period.\n4. An active infection at the distraction site.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "1. The presence of uncontrolled systemic disease.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "disease"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "uncontrolled systemic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "2. Previous radiotherapy on head and neck region.",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "radiotherapy"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "radiotherapy"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "head and neck region"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "Previous"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "Previous"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "3. Chemotherapy within the past 12-month period.",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "Chemotherapy"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "Chemotherapy"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "within"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "month"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "12"\n        