ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. prior randomization to either STAR or usual care study arms;\n2. not a North Carolina resident or residence >2.5-hour drive time from treating hospital;\n3. the only antibiotic associated with patient is administered in the operating room as this likely represents pre-operative infection prophylaxis and not presumed infection;\n4. patients transferred from other acute care hospitals;\n5. patients with a change in code status (i.e., do not resuscitate, do not intubate) within 24 hours after admission due to the general assumption of increased risk of exposure to less aggressive treatment;\n6. patients with infection ruled out during the index hospitalization.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "1. prior randomization to either STAR or usual care study arms;"\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "2. not a North Carolina resident",\n                              "Location": [\n                                "North Carolina"\n                              ],\n                              "Negation": [\n                                "not"\n                              ],\n                              "Residence": [\n                                "resident"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or residence >2.5-hour drive time from treating hospital;",\n                              "Location": [\n                                "treating hospital"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "drive time"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "drive time"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                ">2.5-hour"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                ">"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "2.5"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                "hour"\n                              ],\n                              "Residence": [\n                                "residence"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "3. the only antibiotic associated with patient is administered in the operating room as this likely represents pre-operative infection prophylaxis and not presumed infection;",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "operative infection prophylaxis",\n                        "infection"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "operative infection prophylaxis",\n                        "infection"\n                      ],\n    