ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  The patient is currently being treated at Queen Elizabeth Central Hospital or Kamuzu Central Hospital in the neonatal ward.\n-  The patient is less than 28 days old (neonate).\n-  The patient is deemed to be at risk for jaundice or the patient is undergoing blue light phototherapy for treatment of jaundice.\n-  The patient\'s parent or guardian has provided informed consent for their child to participate.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- The patient is currently being treated at Queen Elizabeth Central Hospital",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "treated"\n                  ],\n                  "Location": [\n                    "Queen Elizabeth Central Hospital"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "currently"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "currently"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or Kamuzu Central Hospital in the neonatal ward.",\n                  "Location": [\n                    "Kamuzu Central Hospital",\n                    "neonatal ward"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- The patient is less than 28 days old (neonate).",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "less than"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "days"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "old"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "28"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "less than 28 days"\n              ],\n              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                "neonate"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- The patient is deemed to be at risk for jaundice",\n              "Condition": [\n                "jaundice"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "jaundice"\n              ],\n              "Risk": [\n                "risk"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or the patient is undergoing blue light phototherapy for treatment of jaundice.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "jaundice"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "jaundice"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "blue light phototherapy"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "blue light phototherapy"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "undergoing"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "undergoing"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- The patient\'s parent or guardian has provided informed consent for their child to participate.",\n      "Family-Member": [\n        "parent",\n        "child"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
