ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  inability to provide informed consent\n-  hemoglobin < 70 g/L\n-  Z scores for weight-for-age (WAZ) or weight-for-height (WHZ) <3,\n-  any maternal or infant chronic illness\n-  administration of any infant vitamin or mineral supplements for the past 2 months\n-  any history of infant antibiotic treatment.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- inability to provide informed consent"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- hemoglobin < 70 g/L",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "hemoglobin"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "< 70 g/L"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "hemoglobin"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "<"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "70"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Unit": [\n                        "g",\n                        "L"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Z scores for weight-for-age (WAZ)",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "weight-for-age",\n                        "WAZ"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "weight-for-age",\n                        "WAZ"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or weight-for-height (WHZ) <3,",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "weight-for-height",\n                        "WHZ"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "<3"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "weight-for-height",\n                        "WHZ"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "<"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "3"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- any maternal",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "maternal"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or infant chronic illness",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "chronic illness"\n                  ],\n                  "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                    "infant"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "chronic illness"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- administration of any infant vitamin or mineral supplements for the past 2 months",\n          "Life-Stage-AndGender": [\n            "infant"\n          ],\n      