ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  1- Patients with a history of any chronic disease (renal and hepatic). 2- Patients refuse to participate in the study. 3- Abuse to other drugs.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- 1- Patients with a history of any chronic disease (renal",\n              "Condition": [\n                "disease"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "history"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "renal"\n              ],\n              "Acuteness": [\n                "chronic"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "history"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and hepatic). 2- Patients refuse to participate in the study.\n 3- Abuse to other drugs.",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "hepatic"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "Abuse"\n              ],\n              "Drug": [\n                "drugs"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Abuse"\n              ],\n              "Other": [\n                "other"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "3- Abuse to other drugs.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Abuse"\n          ],\n          "Drug": [\n            "drugs"\n          ],\n          "Other": [\n            "other"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Abuse"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "3- Abuse to other drugs.",\n      "Condition": [\n        "Abuse"\n      ],\n      "Drug": [\n        "drugs"\n      ],\n      "Other": [\n        "other"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "Abuse"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
