ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  1.Age ≥80 years 2.Brain metastasis 3.With other malignancies 4.Chronic diarrhea, cardiac disease, pregnancy or breast feeding\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- 1.Age ≥80 years",\n              "Age": [\n                "Age"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "≥80 years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "≥"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "80"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "2.Brain metastasis",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "Brain"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "metastasis"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "metastasis"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "3.With other malignancies",\n          "Other": [\n            "other"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "malignancies"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "malignancies"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "4.Chronic diarrhea,          "Condition": [\n            "diarrhea"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "diarrhea"\n          ],\n        