ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients diagnosed with Hunter syndrome\n-  Male at the age of ≥ 5\n-  Adequate abilities (including 6-MWT) to participate in this study in the opinion of the investigator.\n-  Voluntarily signed written informed consent to participation in this study\n-  Consent to contraception\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients diagnosed with Hunter syndrome",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Hunter syndrome"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Hunter syndrome"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Male at the age of ≥ 5",\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "≥"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "5"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "≥ 5"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "age"\n                  ],\n                  "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                    "Male"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Adequate abilities (including 6-MWT) to participate in this study in the opinion of the investigator.",\n              "Observation": [\n                "6-MWT"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "6-MWT"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "Adequate abilities"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Voluntarily signed written informed consent to participation in this study"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Consent to contraception",\n      "Procedure": [\n        "contraception"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "contraception"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "Consent to"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
