ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Patients scheduled for emergency surgery\n2. Patients with a history of drug abuse and / or alcohol abuse 2 years prior to the screening period\n3. One or more of the laboratory findings fall out of the limitations for this study(platelet,hemoglobin,aspartate aminotransferase,etc.)\n4. Pregnant women or those in lactation period\n5. Allergic to drugs used in the study\n6. Patients with respiratory management difficulties (Modified Mallampati grade IV)\n7. Patients have participated in other clinical trial within the 3 months prior to randomization\n8. Any patient judged by the Principal Investigator (PI) or Sub-Investigator to be inappropriate for the subject for any other reason\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "1. Patients scheduled for emergency surgery",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "surgery"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "surgery"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "scheduled"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "scheduled"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "emergency"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "2. Patients with a history of drug abuse",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "drug abuse"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "drug abuse"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "history"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                        "history"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "and / or alcohol abuse 2 years prior to the screening period",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "alcohol abuse"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "alcohol abuse"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "2 years"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Value": [\n                         