ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  biopsy proven rectal cancer (anal verge ≤ 10cm)\n-  neoadjuvant radiotherapy or chemoradiotherapy\n-  no radical surgery after neoadjuvant therapy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- biopsy proven rectal cancer (anal verge ≤ 10cm)",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cancer"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "cancer"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "rectal",\n            "anal verge"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "≤"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "cm"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "10"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "≤ 10cm"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "biopsy"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "biopsy"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- neoadjuvant radiotherapy",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "neoadjuvant radiotherapy"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "neoadjuvant radiotherapy"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or chemoradiotherapy",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "chemoradiotherapy"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "chemoradiotherapy"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\