ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Patients evaluated for residual or recurrent gliomas after initial tumor surgery, external beam radiation and / or chemotherapy with temozolamide.\n2. Male and female\n3. Ages 18 to 70\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "1. Patients evaluated for residual",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "residual"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "evaluated"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "evaluated"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or recurrent gliomas after initial tumor surgery,",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "recurrent",\n                    "initial",\n                    "tumor"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "gliomas"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "surgery"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "gliomas"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "surgery"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "external beam radiation",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "external beam radiation"\n              