ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Heart failure NYHA IIIB-IV\n2. Planned coronary revascularization\n3. Planned major surgery within the next 12 months\n4. Inability to walk for any reason\n5. Comorbidities that would preclude adherence to the rehabilitation program (e.g. arthrosis, active malignancy, major depression or other significant psychiatric disorder, cognitive impairment) - at the discretion of the physician\n6. Life expectancy less than 12 months\n7. Pregnancy\n8. Inability to operate the smart-watch\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "1. Heart failure NYHA IIIB-IV",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "Heart failure"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "NYHA"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "IIIB-IV"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "Heart failure"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "NYHA"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Value": [\n                                        "IIIB",\n                                        "IV"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "2. Planned coronary revascularization",\n                                      "Procedure": [\n                                        "coronary revascularization"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "Planned"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                                        "coronary revascularization"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                        "Planned"\n                                      ]\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "3. Planned major surgery within the next 12 months",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "surgery"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "Planned",\n                                    "within the next 12 months"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "major"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "surgery"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "Planned",\n                                    "next"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                                    "within"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "12"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                    "months"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "4. Inability to walk for any reason",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "Inability to walk"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "Inability to walk"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "5. Comorbidities that would preclude adherence to the rehabilitation program (e.g. arthrosis, active malignancy, major depression",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "Comorbidities",\n                                "arthrosis",\n                                "malignancy",\n                                "depression"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                          