ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Prisoners or any other high-risk population group.\n-  experiencing active psychosis\n-  experiencing active substance abuse disorder\n-  experiencing active suicidality\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Prisoners",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "Prisoners"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "Prisoners"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or any other high-risk population group.",\n                      "Risk": [\n                        "risk"\n                      ],\n                      "Polarity": [\n                        "high"\n                      ],\n                      "Other": [\n                        "other"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "population group"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "population group"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- experiencing active psychosis",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "psychosis"\n                  ],\n          