ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Surgery, or pain relieving procedures within 2 weeks of entry into the study or during the study period\n-  Patients with history of substance abuse (Cut down, Annoyed, Guilty, Eye opener [CAGE] >= 2+), cognitively impaired (MD Anderson Symptom [MDAS] > 7)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Surgery,",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "Surgery"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "Surgery"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or pain relieving procedures within 2 weeks of entry into the study",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "pain relieving procedures"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "pain relieving procedures"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "within"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "weeks"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "2"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "within 2 weeks"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or during the study period",\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ],\n              "Study-Period": [\n                "study period"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "righ