ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Infants of healthy mothers with uncomplicated pregnancies at term, mothers of any ethnic or social background that can speak, read, and understand Swedish to the extent that they can consent in Swedish. An additional inclusion criterion for mothers in the CS groups is vaginal pH ≤ 4 at the time of birth.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Infants of healthy mothers with uncomplicated pregnancies at term, mothers of any ethnic or social background that can speak, read, and understand Swedish to the extent that they can consent in Swedish. An additional inclusion criterion for mothers in the CS groups is vaginal pH ≤ 4 at the time of birth.",\n      "Condition": [\n        "pregnancies"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "pregnancies"\n      ],\n      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n        "mothers",\n        "Infants"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "vaginal pH"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "vaginal pH"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "≤"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "4"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "≤ 4"\n      ],\n      "Birth": [\n        "birth"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Type": [\n        "uncomplicated"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "term"\n      ],\n      "Language": [\n        "Swedish"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "An additional inclusion criterion for mothers in the CS groups is vaginal pH ≤ 4 at the time of birth.",\n      "Observation": [\n        "vaginal pH"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "vaginal pH"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "≤"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "4"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "≤ 4"\n      ],\n      "Birth": [\n        "birth"\n      ],\n      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n        "mothers"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
