ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Participant and/or caregiver unable to give consent and assent\n2. Those participants who the healthcare worker considers to be too ill to participate\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "1. Participant and/or caregiver unable to give consent and assent"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "2. Those participants who the healthcare worker considers to be too ill to participate",\n      "Condition": [\n        "ill"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "ill"\n      ],\n      "Provider": [\n        "healthcare worker"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "considers"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
